  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FEASIBILITY STUDY FOCUSED ON VIABLE COFFEE PARTNER IN EAST AFRICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 2023 funding provided under the AADP was provided to Moyee Coffee (IE) to conduct a feasibility study to identify partnerships that can support small-scale family farms.  assess a business model that can appropriately support small-scale and family owned coffee farms, attract interest from larger supermarkets and conserve the local natural environment and forests. The model is framed around the channelling 66% of profits and dividends back to the farmers, including support to environmental conservation. The target location is East Africa, specifically coffee growing regions in Uganda and Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
